// Parser is a generalized parser for {{.Name}}. Unlike the deterministic
// table-driven parser, it keeps all alternatives allowed by the grammar and
// only commits after checking whether the whole input has zero, one or many
// complete parses. Semantic actions are deferred until the unique complete
// parse is known.
type Parser struct{}

// Init resets the parser. Generalized parsers keep no per-parse state, so
// calling Init between parses is optional.
func (p *Parser) Init() {}

